Package: libonnxruntime1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: cross-platform machine-learning inference engine
 ONNX Runtime is a performance-focused engine for running models in the Open
 Neural Network Exchange (ONNX) format.
 .
 This package contains the CPU runtime shared library.

